{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38018","headline":"丙寅二月二十二日抚州如归馆雨中有怀诸朝客 · 韩偓","name":"丙寅二月二十二日抚州如归馆雨中有怀诸朝客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凄凄恻恻又微嚬，欲话羇愁忆故人。\n薄酒旋醒寒彻夜，好花虚谢雨藏春。\n萍蓬已恨爲逋客，江岭那知见侍臣。\n未必交情系贫富，柴门自古少车尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}